<Base lang="en" title="Contact" description="Contact the KUAS Photography Club by email or Instagram DM for visits, photography requests, sponsorship, press and photo use.">
  <PageHero edge="CONTACT ▸ KUAS PHOTOGRAPHY CLUB" title="Contact us" lead="For photography requests, sponsorship, press inquiries or other questions, contact the student-run club by email or Instagram DM. It may take a few days to reply." />
  <section class="wrap"><ContactWays lang="en" /></section>
  <section class="section"><div class="wrap prose">
    <h2>Requests and inquiries</h2><p>Include your name or organization, contact details, your request and any relevant dates or locations. For photography or photo use, explain the intended use. Availability, fees, deadlines and image usage conditions are discussed individually.</p>
    <p>Information you provide is used to respond to your inquiry and make necessary contact. Members receive routine notices through LINE or other chats introduced by the organizers.</p>
    <h2>Photo use</h2><p>Photographs belong to their photographers. Ask before reuse, editing or commercial use. Taking a photo, website publication, social media, exhibitions, sales, commissioned work and personal use require separate consideration of the photographer, people depicted and facility conditions. A submission for exhibition or sale does not authorize website publication.</p>
    <h2>Removal and privacy concerns</h2><p>To discuss removal or visibility of material on club-managed websites or social accounts, send the URL and your request. The organizers will review it and consider action within the channels they control. Complete removal of third-party reposts or all copies on the internet cannot be promised.</p>
    <p>For membership procedures, activity registration or insurance conditions, ask the organizers. See <a href="/en/join/">Visit / Join</a> and the <a href="/guidelines/en/">participation guide</a>.</p>
  </div></section>
</Base>
